-- INSTRUMENT: Broadcasting Act (Amendment of Third Schedule) Notification 2010 (S 559/2010), made under section 65 of the Broadcasting Act.
-- Deposit: ../../../broadcasting-amendment-of-third-schedule-notification-2010/registers/source-bundle/BA1994-S559-2010.txt (e-Gazette PDF, pdftotext -layout, unedited).
-- Made on 28 September 2010, first published in the Government Gazette, Electronic Edition, on 30 September 2010 at 5:00 pm, and (paragraph 1) "shall come into operation on 1st October 2010".

§ `Paragraphs 1 and 2: the Third Schedule deleted and a new one substituted`

-- src:3 | First published in the Government Gazette, Electronic Edition, on 30th September 2010 at 5:00 pm.
-- src:20 | Citation and commencement
-- src:21 | 1. This Notification may be cited as the Broadcasting Act
-- src:22 | (Amendment of Third Schedule) Notification 2010 and shall come
-- src:23 | into operation on 1st October 2010.
-- src:25 | Deletion and substitution of Third Schedule to Act
-- src:26 | 2. The Third Schedule to the Broadcasting Act is deleted and
-- src:27 | the following Schedule substituted therefor:
-- src:28 | ‘‘THIRD SCHEDULE
-- src:29 | Section 31(6)
-- src:31 | RELEVANT LICENSABLE BROADCASTING SERVICE
-- src:33 | First column Second column
-- src:34 | Licensable broadcasting service Provider
-- src:35 | 1. Subscription nationwide television service (a) StarHub Cable Vision Ltd.
-- src:36 | (b) SingNet Pte. Ltd.’’.
-- src:38 | Made this 28th day of September 2010.
@ref S 559/2010 publication line, paras 1 and 2 and the date made (src:3-38)
`the Third Schedule as substituted by S 559/2010` MEANS
    `Third Schedule version` WITH `source` IS "S 559/2010, made 28 September 2010, first published 30 September 2010 at 5:00 pm, in operation from 1 October 2010"
                                 , `takes effect on` IS (Date 1 10 2010)
                                 , `published on` IS (Date 30 9 2010)
                                 , `providers of the subscription nationwide television service` IS LIST "StarHub Cable Vision Ltd.", "SingNet Pte. Ltd."
